title: "rsfgsea: Decor, Classic fgsea, and Native Blitz GSEA"
version: "0.4.0"
abstract: >-
  A high-performance Rust implementation of preranked Gene Set Enrichment
  Analysis with redundancy-aware decor, fgsea-compatible, and native
  blitzGSEA-compatible workflows. Blitz mode targets blitzgsea 1.3.54.
